        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span>5 min read</span>
      </p>
      <p class="article__byline">By <span class="article__author">Leonida Guides Team</span> <span class="article__ai">· Written with AI help and fact-checked against the cited sources.</span> <a class="article__ai-link" href="/about/">How we work</a></p><p class="article__lead">GTA 6 pre-load is live: up to 212 GB on PS5 and Xbox Series X|S. Start times, download-time estimates, space tips and a fix if the download stalls.</p>
