<p>Polygon says about 210 GB. Rockstar says “up to 212 GB”. Plan for 212.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Wrong date warning:</strong> an old press release said pre-load starts on 12 November. That is wrong. Pre-load started on <strong>10 November</strong>. 12 November is the day boxed copies reached shops.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="how-long-will-it-take" tabindex="-1">How long will it take?</h2>
<p>There are no official times. One real example from New Zealand provider Chorus (via 1News, 18 Nov). Your speed will be different.</p>
<div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Table"><table class="table">
